---
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# Apache-family servers (including LiteSpeed). Written for the root-domain build only.
#
# 1. Unknown URLs show the site's own 404 page. Without this, valid URLs work exactly the same and unknown URLs
#    still return 404; the host just shows its default error page.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html

# 2. Correct types for the module and WebAssembly files of the in-browser engines (Pyodide for the Python lessons,
#    sql.js for SQL). Browsers refuse a module script served with a non-JavaScript type, and WebAssembly streaming
#    needs application/wasm, so without these the Python lessons fail to start on hosts that do not know .mjs.
<IfModule mod_mime.c>
  AddType text/javascript .mjs
  AddType application/wasm .wasm
</IfModule>
